WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:10.718
In tutorial 4.6, you'll read
a report, download its files,

00:00:10.768 --> 00:00:13.698
and share it with a link that
stops working when you choose.

00:00:14.728 --> 00:00:17.203
First, click Reports in the sidebar.

00:00:17.253 --> 00:00:21.473
Every report your runs and weekly
checks deliver is here, newest first.

00:00:22.478 --> 00:00:27.023
Filter by website or by type.
Here, it's the weekly site report.

00:00:27.073 --> 00:00:29.069
Then click the report to open it.

00:00:30.042 --> 00:00:34.934
Each report opens with a short summary of
what changed, and the next step to take.

00:00:37.042 --> 00:00:41.736
Below, read the week in brief, with the
actions recommended for you, in order.

00:00:43.538 --> 00:00:48.893
Under Downloads, open each file. A
written page comes with Word, HTML,

00:00:48.943 --> 00:00:50.932
Markdown and its images too.

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:55.410
To keep a copy of the whole
page, click Save as PDF.

00:00:57.426 --> 00:01:01.026
To show the report to someone
without an account, click Share.

00:01:01.076 --> 00:01:03.108
Choose how many days the link works.

00:01:04.926 --> 00:01:09.191
Then click Create a link, and copy
it. Every live link is listed here,

00:01:09.241 --> 00:01:11.174
and Turn it off stops it at once.

00:01:12.951 --> 00:01:17.101
Finally, Send it now sends this report
to your company's delivery list,

00:01:17.151 --> 00:01:18.885
without waiting for the schedule.

00:01:20.426 --> 00:01:25.451
So, find the report, read the summary
and download the files, save it as a PDF,

00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:27.354
share a link, or send it now.

00:01:28.348 --> 00:01:33.148
You can share every result. Next, see
how your website describes your business,

00:01:33.198 --> 00:01:35.245
in tutorial 4.7.
